  description:
  - A largely unaltered form of the average carrot.
  leftText: 
  rightText: The commensalism nature of this plant begins the moment it first roots
    itself into the ground. Instead of growing roots downward, it instead grows horizontally,
    intertwining with roots of adjacent Tumerics
